        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The <computeroutput>TotalCount</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>NumCandidates</computeroutput> are set to the the total profile count of the indirect call <computeroutput>I</computeroutput> and the number of profitable candidates in the given array (which is sorted in reverse order of profitability).</para>
